 "remarks": "In the heart of downtown Stamford! Spacious & sunny 4th floor Co-Op unit. Large studio with a kitchen alcove with full size refrigerator, gas /oven range & dishwasher. Full bath with tub, closet & dressing area. Heat, hot water and cooking gas included. Laundry in basement. Tenant pays non-refundable credit/application fee, electricity and liability & renter's insurance. Convenient to all major routes and amenities ~ near to shops, restaurants, theaters, bus line, etc. Spacious, sun-filled, light and bright ~ move in, unpack and enjoy the vibes of City life!",
